{
	"name": "床头的旧布偶",
	"cast": {
		"princess": {
			"kind": "princess",
			"at": [
				0,
				8
			],
			"visual": "normal",
			"anim": "idle",
			"dir": "down"
		},
		"doll": {
			"kind": "trap:plush_doll",
			"at": [
				10,
				6
			]
		}
	},
	"steps": [
		{
			"act": 1,
			"actions": [
				{
					"time": 0.5,
					"do": "fade_in"
				},
				{
					"state": "giggle",
					"do": "voice"
				}
			],
			"wait": 0.5
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（床头坐着一只旧布偶。毛线织的耳朵，脸上补过好几回，纽扣做的眼睛亮亮的）",
			"act": 1
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……好旧。谁的呀，放在反省室里。",
			"emotion": "question"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……嘿嘿，有点可爱。反正也睡不着，借我抱一下。",
			"emotion": "happy"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（她抱着布偶躺到床上，把脸埋进它软软的肚子里。闻起来有一点点灰尘的味道，还有一点点……像是很久以前的被子的味道）"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……奇怪。好像……以前也抱过这样的……",
			"emotion": "sad"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（眼皮越来越重。她迷迷糊糊地睡着了——）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"time": 0.4,
					"do": "fade_out"
				}
			],
			"act": 2
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（……腰上，有什么东西轻轻地戳了一下）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"time": 0.4,
					"do": "fade_in"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "doll",
					"zone": "waist",
					"fx": "hand",
					"repeat": 3,
					"interval": 0.3,
					"do": "tickle"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……嗯……别闹……",
			"emotion": "giggle"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（又戳了一下。然后是两下、三下。一只软软的布手，沿着腰侧一节一节地往下捏）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "doll",
					"zone": "waist",
					"fx": "hand",
					"repeat": 8,
					"interval": 0.2,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "giggle",
					"do": "pose"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……嘻……嘻嘻……在做梦……一定是在做梦……",
			"emotion": "giggle"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（布手顺着腰滑下去，钻进膝盖窝，用毛线做的指头在那里挠圈圈）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "doll",
					"zone": "thigh",
					"fx": "hand",
					"repeat": 10,
					"interval": 0.18,
					"do": "tickle"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "噗……！哈……膝、膝盖窝……！",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"time": 0.3,
					"do": "shake"
				}
			],
			"emotion": "giggle"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（她笑醒了。……布偶好好地被她抱在怀里，一动不动，纽扣眼睛无辜地看着天花板）"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……？",
			"emotion": "question"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……一定是做梦。再睡。",
			"emotion": "sad"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（第二次，布手从大腿外侧慢慢爬上来，爬到腿根那里，用小小的指尖一下一下地点）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "doll",
					"zone": "thigh",
					"fx": "hand",
					"repeat": 12,
					"interval": 0.16,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "helpless_1",
					"do": "pose"
				},
				{
					"do": "voice",
					"state": "laugh"
				}
			],
			"act": 3
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……哈……哈哈……腿……腿根不行……！",
			"emotion": "helpless_1"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（她又笑醒了。布偶还是一动不动。只是……它的一只手，好像比刚才更靠近她的腰了一点点）"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……你。是你吧。",
			"emotion": "angry"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "布偶",
			"text": "……"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "我不睡了！我盯着你！",
			"emotion": "angry"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（……盯了三分钟。眼皮又打架了。第三次——这一次，两只布手一起动了：一只挠腰，一只钻膝盖窝，像是怕她再醒过来，挠得又轻又快）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "doll",
					"zone": "waist",
					"fx": "hand",
					"repeat": 14,
					"interval": 0.12,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "doll",
					"zone": "thigh",
					"fx": "hand",
					"repeat": 14,
					"interval": 0.12,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "helpless_2",
					"do": "pose"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "哈哈哈哈！抓、抓到你了——哈哈哈！放、放手——不对，是我放手……我放不开——哈哈哈！",
			"emotion": "helpless_2"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（她想把布偶扔开，可两只布手紧紧勾着她的衣服。越挣越痒，越痒越使不上劲）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "doll",
					"zone": "waist",
					"fx": "hand",
					"repeat": 14,
					"interval": 0.11,
					"do": "tickle"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "（一圈星光从怀里炸开，把布偶弹到了床尾……哈……哈啊……身体轻飘飘的……好舒服……）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"time": 0.5,
					"do": "flash"
				},
				{
					"sound": "star_burst",
					"do": "sfx"
				},
				{
					"sound": "water_release",
					"volume": -2.0,
					"do": "sfx"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"time": 0.4,
					"do": "shake"
				},
				{
					"state": "laugh",
					"do": "voice"
				}
			],
			"act": "burst",
			"wait": 1.0
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（布偶在床尾翻了个身，又慢吞吞地爬了回来，趴在她刚释放完、软得发烫的腿上）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "helpless_2",
					"do": "pose"
				}
			],
			"act": 4
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……不、不要过来……现在碰哪里都……！",
			"emotion": "helpless_2"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（毛线指头在膝盖窝里轻轻一勾——就一下。她整个人弹了起来）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "doll",
					"zone": "thigh",
					"fx": "hand",
					"repeat": 8,
					"interval": 0.14,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"time": 0.4,
					"do": "shake"
				},
				{
					"do": "pose",
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "helpless_2"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "哈哈哈哈！一下就……一下就受不了……哈哈哈！",
			"emotion": "helpless_2"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（布偶挠了好一会儿，才心满意足地松开手，躺回床头，纽扣眼睛又亮晶晶地看着天花板）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "doll",
					"zone": "waist",
					"fx": "hand",
					"repeat": 6,
					"interval": 0.2,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "helpless_1",
					"do": "pose"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（她把布偶拎起来，想狠狠地瞪它一眼——然后看见了它背后的绣花）"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（褪了色的线，歪歪扭扭地绣着两个手拉手的小人。……和排水管那块手帕上的，一模一样）"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……这个……",
			"emotion": "surprise"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……队长的东西。又是队长的东西。",
			"emotion": "sad"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……我才不会认错。……可是，这只布偶，我先替你保管着。",
			"emotion": "sad"
		},
		{
			"actions": [
				{
					"state": "",
					"do": "voice"
				},
				{
					"time": 0.6,
					"do": "fade_out"
				}
			],
			"wait": 0.7
		}
	]
}
